    "body": "Thank you for this report and for the list of posts.\n\nTriage: `P3`, `effort:high`. A post option that has no effect, with no message, is wrong behaviour. The program itself is not unsafe, and you can set the unit on the control by hand. A `P3` is worked before planned work.\n\nIf your Doosan or Mazak control needs a specific word at the end of a program to set the unit, please tell us which word. Please do not attach output from Fusion 360 or HSMWorks.\n",
