    "updated_at": "2026-11-16T19:13:43Z",
    "body": "Thank you again for this report. It is fixed in `main` by PR #2208.\n\nThe mill posts now write the requested end unit when the \"End units\" option is set, or they write a note that names the post where the option has no effect. The Post dialog offers the option only for posts that support it.\n\nThe fix ships in the next release (v0.23.0). You can test it now with a build from `main`.\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
